<title>FRANCE: Clinton aide in Paris but not specially for Zaire.</title>
<headline>Clinton aide in Paris but not specially for Zaire.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. President Bill Clinton's national security advisor Anthony Lake discussed Zaire and the Middle East with French officials in Paris on Friday.</p>
<p>Lake was in Paris on Friday for a briefing by aides to President Jacques Chirac about the French leader's Middle East trip last week, an official told Reuters. They also discussed Zaire and other topics, he said.</p>
</text>
